  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Lang Ya blessed land, after Heavenly Giant Solor destroys ancient tree prison cage, a wooden hand grabs the silver giant’s leg. A wooden giant then appears from under the soil, lets go, lowers its body, and slams its shoulder into the silver giant’s chest, knocking it to the ground. It attacks relentlessly, jumps into the sky, and crashes down on the silver giant.",
      "chapters": [
        1574
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "sys_heavenly_giant_solor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It inherited the property of ancient tree prison cage. Thunder Ghost True Monarch calls the display the power of Genesis Lotus true inheritance. As first supreme elder of Heavenly Lotus Sect and inheritor of that true inheritance, Chen Yi suppresses both the silver giant and the immemorial rock dragon without using karma divine tree.",
      "chapters": [
        1574
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_thunder_ghost_true_monarch",
        "inh_genesis_lotus_true_inheritance",
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect",
        "char_chen_yi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the silver giant destroys a giant tree divine statue, Chen Yi creates another one.",
      "chapters": [
        1575
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "silver-giant-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit moves the silver giant, resists an attack of the giant tree divine statue, and crashes into the ancient tree prison cage trapping the rock dragon.",
      "chapters": [
        1577
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "statue-crash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Trapped in Fang Yuan’s super formation, Chen Yi still has great battle strength from immortal killer moves like ancient tree prison cage, giant tree divine statue, karma divine tree, and others, making those superb killer moves very difficult for Fang Yuan to handle.",
